   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s005",
   "start": 8.04,
   "end": 13.46,
   "line": "On every screen, the same thing. The rock, and its path. The rock is still coming.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s006",
   "start": 13.46,
   "end": 18.66,
   "line": "But now you have a word on a whiteboard. Nudge. You can't catch it, Kai says.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s007",
   "start": 18.66,
   "end": 19.8,
   "line": "Bo looks offended.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s008",
   "start": 19.8,
   "end": 25.0,
   "line": "So what if you had to stop an asteroid? Not in a movie. The real way.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s009",
   "start": 25.0,
   "end": 25.84,
   "line": "Think about it.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s010",
   "start": 25.84,
   "end": 28.48,
   "line": "The rock weighs about three and a half billion kilograms,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s011",
   "start": 28.48,
   "end": 31.54,
   "line": "and it moves twenty kilometres every second.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s012",
   "start": 31.54,
   "end": 33.92,
   "line": "Catching it means stopping all that energy at once.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s013",
   "start": 33.92,
   "end": 37.18,
   "line": "About a hundred and seventy megatons. Bo's arms are strong.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s014",
   "start": 37.18,
   "end": 39.72,
   "line": "But a hundred and seventy megatons would turn Bo,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s015",
   "start": 39.72,
   "end": 43.56,
   "line": "the rock, and the town into vapour. And blowing it up is no better.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s016",
   "start": 43.56,
   "end": 47.3,
   "line": "You'd turn one big rock into lots of smaller rocks, all still coming.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s017",
   "start": 47.3,
   "end": 52.08,
   "line": "So the trick isn't stopping it. It's changing where it goes. A tiny bit.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s018",
   "start": 52.08,
   "end": 55.46,
   "line": "Very early. Here's the magic.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s019",
   "start": 55.46,
   "end": 60.16,
   "line": "Change a rock's speed by one centimetre per second. Much slower than walking.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s020",
   "start": 60.16,
   "end": 61.38,
   "line": "Do it ten years early,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s021",
   "start": 61.38,
   "end": 65.6,
   "line": "and that tiny push adds up to thousands of kilometres by the time it arrives.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s022",
   "start": 65.6,
   "end": 67.18,
   "line": "Enough to miss the whole planet.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s023",
   "start": 67.18,
   "end": 69.44,
   "line": "It's like steering a huge ship.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s024",
   "start": 69.44,
   "end": 72.48,
   "line": "Turn the wheel early, and a tiny turn is enough.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s025",
   "start": 72.48,
   "end": 75.56,
   "line": "Turn it late, and nothing can save you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s026",
   "start": 75.56,
   "end": 77.94,
   "line": "Push it late, and you need a giant shove.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s027",
   "start": 77.94,
   "end": 81.62,
   "line": "Push it early, and a nudge is enough.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s028",
   "start": 81.62,
   "end": 83.94,
   "line": "That's exactly what NASA tested.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s029",
   "start": 83.94,
   "end": 88.16,
   "line": "They picked an asteroid called Didymos, which has its own little moon called Dimorphos.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s030",
   "start": 88.16,
   "end": 91.9,
   "line": "The moon is about a hundred and fifty metres wide. The same size as your rock.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s031",
   "start": 91.9,
   "end": 95.56,
   "line": "In 2022, the DART spacecraft, about the size of a small car,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s032",
   "start": 95.56,
   "end": 100.18,
   "line": "flew straight into it, at twenty-two thousand kilometres an hour.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s033",
   "start": 100.18,
   "end": 103.8,
   "line": "NASA hoped to change the moon's orbit by at least seventy-three seconds.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s034",
   "start": 103.8,
   "end": 108.48,
   "line": "It changed it by thirty-two minutes. And here's the surprise.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s035",
   "start": 108.48,
   "end": 111.82,
   "line": "The rubble that blasted off the surface pushed the rock even more,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s036",
   "start": 111.82,
   "end": 114.14,
   "line": "like a rocket engine made of gravel.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s037",
   "start": 114.14,
   "end": 119.26,
   "line": "Now a European spacecraft called Hera is on its way to look at the crash site up close.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s038",
   "start": 119.26,
   "end": 121.64,
   "line": "Scientists have a gentler idea too.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s039",
   "start": 121.64,
   "end": 125.94,
   "line": "A heavy spacecraft parks next to the asteroid. It never touches it.",
