    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s040",
   "start": 125.94,
   "end": 131.48,
   "line": "Its own gravity slowly tugs the rock off course. It's called a gravity tractor.",
