   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s041",
   "start": 131.48,
   "end": 135.44,
   "line": "One idea is that a twenty-tonne spacecraft could move a two-hundred-metre rock,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s042",
   "start": 135.44,
   "end": 138.64,
   "line": "if it had about twenty years. It's slow.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s043",
   "start": 138.64,
   "end": 142.02,
   "line": "But it doesn't need to hit anything. Ravi likes this one.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s044",
   "start": 142.02,
   "end": 147.22,
   "line": "It sounds like what he does, just slower. So you practise.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s045",
   "start": 147.22,
   "end": 151.58,
